            </rule>
            <rule name="Triple Battery" id="b6ca-a2fd-7c8c-4b46" hidden="false">
              <description>This Unit is considered to have three Dial In Values: 8,12, and 16. When this Unit performs an Attack Action, you may only select one of this Unit&apos;s Canon à Orbite Basse weapons at a time. When you resolve an Attack Action with one of these Weapons, this Unit regains Cumbersome.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Flexible Fire" id="cc06-680d-f398-5dd2" hidden="false">
              <description>When making an Attack Action with the Carnot Mobile Anti-Aethership Battery, instead of using Indirect Fire or Direct Fire for the Canon à Orbite Basse, you may choose to fire with its AP Shells. If you do, resolve the Attack with the Canon à Orbite Basse (AP) statline</description>
