              <rules>
                <rule name="Decoy" id="9ae0-41bd-f3de-9b41" hidden="false">
                  <description>During deployment, place a Decoy Token anywhere on the Battlefield within 16&quot; of this Unit. If, when this Unit is Attacked, the Decoy is closer to the Attacker than this Unit, they must select the Decoy as the target of the Attack instead. The Decoy is treated as being an independent Troop Unit for the purposes of these Attacks, but is not an actual Unit, and does not count as a Unit or Model for the purposes of Suppression, Objectives or Scoring. When the Decoy is reduced to 0 HP it is destroyed and removed from the Battlefield.</description>
