              <modifiers>
                <modifier field="name" type="append" value="CORE Partisan"/>
                <modifier field="description" type="append" value="CORE Partisan"/>
              </modifiers>
            </infoLink>
            <infoLink name="Designated Leader" id="97ae-d06c-dbd5-3006" hidden="false" targetId="8e52-a616-aab9-73b8" type="rule"/>
          </infoLinks>
          <profiles>
            <profile name="Agent Fabien" id="b201-521a-0e79-ea88" hidden="false" typeId="312c-13ed-50aa-27a6" typeName="Attache Composition">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="d6ab-192f-515b-f06b">NFR, (CORE) Partisan, (CORE) Infantry, (AUX) Recon, Troop, Hero, Command</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Base Size" typeId="7451-1f52-67d5-01a8">25mm</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Maximum Number in Platoon" typeId="d3f4-a3f4-2fe1-5fee">1</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Partisan Activity" id="74a7-bee1-1202-18a5" hidden="false">
              <description>At the start of the game, Agent Fabien and any Unit he is Attached are considered Undercover, and are not deployed onto the Battlefield. At the end of the first Setup Phase, place one of each of the Red Menace Tokens Face down and more than 8&quot; from Enemy Units. When an Enemy moves within 3&quot; of a token, or as an Activation, you may reveal a Token.

Red Menace Tokens:
Improvised Bomb: Make an attack treating the token as a blast template with the following template. S4 AP4 D4, Blast 3, High Explosive, Close In.

Red Scare: All Enemy Units within 3&quot; gain 1D5 Suppression tokens.

In Plain Sight: Replace this token with Agent Fabien&apos;s Unit. This Unit may activate immediately, interrupting your Opponent&apos;s turn. Once this Activation is finished, your Opponent may finish their Activation as normal.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Ringleader" id="5f01-56d9-4975-25a8" hidden="false">
              <description>If Agent Fabien is your Field Commander, every time a CORE Partisan Unit in your Army selects an Enemy Unit as the target of an Attack, it gains an Aim token. When resolving an Attack with a Partisan Unit, you may spend an Aim Token to improve one of their Weapon Profiles&apos; Values by one until the Attack is resolved.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry name="Agent Fabien" id="7381-c8ae-6f66-22e6" hidden="false" import="true" type="model">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="340a-7e9b-74cf-9bda-min" field="selections" includeChildSelections="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="min" value="1"/>
                <constraint id="340a-7e9b-74cf-9bda-max" field="selections" includeChildSelections="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
