            <rule name="Heart of a Lion" id="ba71-be34-0ef1-ffd9" hidden="false">
              <description>Colonel Jean-Claude Gaultier must be your Field Commander. Colonel Jean-Claude Gaultier may only be taken if your selected Army Specialization is 3e Régiment Étranger d&apos;Infanterie “Lionhearts”

This Unit may issue Orders at a range of 16&quot;. All Zouave and Monowheel Units in this Army may reroll 1s and 2s for Melee Attacks.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Daring Dismount" id="99f0-327c-a28a-00bb" hidden="false">
              <description>Once per Game, when Colonel Jean-Claude Gaultier performs a Charge Attack, you may choose for him to dismount, if you do, replace his Mounted Model with his On-Foot Model, he loses the Cavalry Keyword and gains the Troop Keyword. Until this Attack is resolved, double the Hits value of his Lance Fist Weapon.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Heavyweight" id="15f6-90ea-3d2c-1a27" hidden="false">
              <description>When Jean-Claude is on foot, his Lance Fist gains Warding. Any time he is the target of a melee attack, roll a D5 and reduce the Hits profile of any weapons targeting him by the result, to a minimum of 1.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry name="Colonel Jean-Claude Gaultier" id="a8a6-b853-9561-a9fb" hidden="false" import="true" type="model">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="1858-eb2c-12c0-470a-min" field="selections" includeChildSelections="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="min" value="1"/>
                <constraint id="1858-eb2c-12c0-470a-max" field="selections" includeChildSelections="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
