    <selectionEntryGroup name="Army Specializations" id="322d-14bc-a3ac-9bba" hidden="false">
      <selectionEntries>
        <selectionEntry name="Grande Armée 1re Division d&apos;Infanterie “Grognards”" id="e834-74f8-a835-7d46" hidden="false" import="true" sortIndex="1" type="upgrade">
          <rules>
            <rule name="Élan Vital" id="7733-0c63-0f99-4983" hidden="false">
              <description>During the Scoring phase if every Unit you control on the battlefield has fulfilled at least one of the following conditions, gain a point of Élan:

* The Unit is within 6” of another friendly Unit.
* The Unit performed an Attack Action this round.
* This Unit is within 3” of an objective.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Vital Force" id="f34d-2259-1352-4b15" hidden="false">
              <description>For each point of Élan gain the following benefits:
* At 1 point of Élan gain the following benefit:
* All Units gain an Aim Token in the Command Phase.

* At 2 points gain the following benefit:
* When a Unit becomes affected by a Flare Gun it also gains an Aim Token.

* At 3 points gain the following benefit:
* Any amount of Aim Tokens may be spent to increase the armor penetration on their weapon profiles. (May spend any combination to raise AP, and any number to raise to hit.)</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
        <selectionEntry name="3e Régiment Étranger d&apos;Infanterie “Lionhearts”" id="b372-a86b-8f3a-2adb" hidden="false" import="true" sortIndex="2" type="upgrade">
          <rules>
            <rule name="Legio Patria Nostra" id="a303-e8b6-ab01-c569" hidden="false">
              <description>During the Command Phase, select a National Idea from any other faction. Your army gains that rule, and that faction’s Keyword, until the next Command Phase. You may not select the same National Idea twice in one match.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Lionhearts" id="c557-4f6d-4ce2-b253" hidden="false">
              <description>Troops Units may increase the Hits profile of their melee Weapons by 1 if their Unit is at or below half of its starting strength.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
        <selectionEntry name="6e Régiment du Génie “Molemen”" id="01f3-40ad-dadc-6b48" hidden="false" import="true" sortIndex="3" type="upgrade">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="error" type="add" value="This Specialization requires at least two Units with the Burrowing Special Rule">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="fa56-afdd-817a-77fe" childName="Burrowing" field="selections" includeChildForces="true" includeChildSelections="true" scope="roster" shared="true" type="lessThan" value="2"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <profiles>
            <profile name="Knock out the Beams!" id="6b63-9a24-ac61-6d27" hidden="false" typeId="60a8-a233-a953-97f1" typeName="Special Requisition">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Cost" typeId="fdc2-ccd7-0950-5670">1 IP</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effects" typeId="8280-2b12-dd95-5313">Select a Taupe Fortification. Apply a Bombard Token to every Terrain Feature within 4&quot; of the Taupe, and perform a Free Attack with the Tunnel Collapse Profile against every Unit within 4&quot; of the Taupe. Models destroyed by this Attack do not leave Wreckage on the Battlefield. The Taupe is Destroyed after these interactions are resolved.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Tunnel Collapse" id="deb2-4aa4-bc92-4e35" hidden="false" typeId="Weapon" typeName="Weapon">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Range" typeId="23fd-52ca-c658-ab9b">E</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Hits" typeId="60de-dad6-12a2-68b4">1D10</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Armor Penetration" typeId="a8b4-f834-f9e0-2df8">4</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Damage" typeId="92d5-d0e9-5e47-86ca">1D5</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="d007-3244-18f1-86d1">High Explosive</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="bd5a-5880-4285-ad9f">Melee, Blunt, Kinetic</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <rules>
            <rule name="À Me Suivre, Tu Passes" id="8816-b24f-2a38-de46" hidden="false">
              <description>Each Troop Unit in your Army may, once per Round, travel through a Secret Tunnel without spending an Action. If it does, the Range of that ability is set to 15&quot;, and may be increased normally from there.

Troop Units in your Army may travel through Secret Tunnels twice each Round, but may not exit through a Taupe that they have entered through that Round.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Surprise Attack" id="ffec-1b38-9483-83fe" hidden="false">
              <description>Each time a Unit in your Army exits a Taupe Token, it gains an Aim Token.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
        <selectionEntry name="4e Division Cuirassée &quot;Chevaliers&quot;" id="d8a4-2c4f-d3d4-9db4" hidden="false" import="true" sortIndex="4" type="upgrade">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="error" type="add" value="This Specialization requires at least one Armor Platoon or Mechanized Platoon">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="and">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition childId="fae0-4a12-4ae4-5f9b" field="forces" includeChildForces="true" includeChildSelections="true" scope="roster" shared="true" type="lessThan" value="1"/>
                    <condition childId="29bb-b3e2-3fbb-9ad5" field="forces" includeChildForces="true" includeChildSelections="true" scope="roster" shared="true" type="lessThan" value="1"/>
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Hunting Pack" id="023a-a339-ed86-08aa" hidden="false">
              <description>Tracked Vehicles in this Army may make the Fallback Reaction for the cost of 1 Action instead of 2.

Each time a friendly Vehicle Unit targets a Unit with an Attack Action, add a Hunting Pack Token to the targeted Unit. Each time a Unit with a Hunting Pack Token is the target of an Attack Action, friendly Units may remove a Hunting Pack Token from the target to gain an Aim Token. They may do this a number of times equal to Hunting Pack Tokens on that Unit. They may not remove a Hunting Pack Token placed during this Attack Action.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Chevaliers" id="a9ef-79ef-3d33-dfd0" hidden="false">
              <description>When a Tracked Vehicle Unit Activates, it may remove 1 Suppression Token from any Friendly Units within 8”.


Tracked Vehicles, and all Melee Weapons they are equipped with, are treated as having the Charge! Special Rule and always Attack first when they are Engaged with an Enemy Unit.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
        <selectionEntry name="NAB 2e Division Marocaine" id="beb7-8924-1eaa-59d1" hidden="false" import="true" sortIndex="5" type="upgrade">
          <rules>
            <rule name="Shifting Sands" id="7558-6fe5-4ddb-0ee7" hidden="false">
              <description>Units in this army ignore the effects of Rough Terrain.


Units in this army with the Tracked keyword may pass through terrain and choose not to remove it.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Ambush" id="bd86-3079-d6a1-be58" hidden="false">
              <description>Up to 2 Troops Units in this army may be placed in Ambush. Units in Ambush are not placed on the table, but are counted as activations on the battlefield. During your turn, you may choose to Activate a Unit in Ambush. If you do, deploy that Unit onto the battlefield within or touching a piece of Medium or Heavy Terrain that is at least 4&quot; from an Enemy Unit. That Unit may take all actions as normal.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
        <selectionEntry name="7e Division de Chasseurs Canadiens “Coureur des Bois”" id="f142-1c3c-2324-7bd8" hidden="false" import="true" sortIndex="6" type="upgrade">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="error" type="add" value="This Specialization requires at least one Recon Platoon">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="df9c-5241-555f-2018" field="forces" includeChildForces="true" includeChildSelections="true" scope="roster" shared="true" type="lessThan" value="1"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Defenders of the North" id="2cfc-9e1a-2309-b6eb" hidden="false">
              <description>Monowheel Chasseurs, CAIM 38 &quot;Danton&quot; Chasseur de Char Walkers, AMR 36 Coccinelle Tankette Squads, and AM40 Lafayette Armored Cars gain an Aim Token after making an Attack Action

Troops units gain an Aim Token after performing the Capture Action

Units gain an Aim Token after performing the Overwatch Action</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Unleash Canadian Industry" id="4345-d22a-a35e-2a51" hidden="false">
              <description>Vehicle Units in your army gain the Supply Gathering Action. If a Vehicle already has the Supply Gathering Action, it loses it and gains the Logistics Special Rule instead.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
        <selectionEntry name="5e Régiment de Tirailleurs Tonkinois" id="efe9-81c5-2847-d55c" hidden="false" import="true" sortIndex="7" type="upgrade">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="error" type="add" value="This Specialization requires at least one Infantry Platoon">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="2250-4111-e2c2-bb10" field="forces" includeChildForces="true" includeChildSelections="true" scope="roster" shared="true" type="lessThan" value="1"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Bane of the Bonapartist" id="5ee5-9722-b436-950e" hidden="false">
              <description>Enemy Units must reroll successful Morale Checks.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Guerilla Warfare" id="757c-8f45-014c-2c74" hidden="false">
              <description>Troop Units in your army gain +1 to the AP on their weapons when targeting a Unit with the Vehicle Keyword. 

When a Unit in your army that is receiving Cover targets an enemy unit that is not receiving the benefits of cover with an attack action, the attacking Unit gains an aim token. 

When a Troops Unit in your army uses a reaction to make itself ineligible as a target, apply a Concussive token to the Attacking Unit.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
      </selectionEntries>
    </selectionEntryGroup>
    <selectionEntryGroup name="Specialists" id="ca18-74ae-d4ee-d4a2" hidden="false">
      <selectionEntries>
        <selectionEntry name="Medic Element" id="57aa-112e-176a-fbbe" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
